invested in mortgage loans and other real estate assets. You
must purchase at least 150&nbsp;units for $3,000 if you are
purchasing through an IRA or other qualified account. If you are
not purchasing through a qualified account, you must purchase at
least 250&nbsp;units for $5,000.
