deduction and credit are to be allocated among partners as set
forth in the relevant partnership agreement. Section&nbsp;704(b)
provides, however, that if an allocation to a partner under the
partnership agreement of income, gain, loss, deduction or credit
or items thereof does not have substantial economic effect, such
allocation will instead be made in accordance with the
partner&#146;s interest in us determined by taking into account
all facts and circumstances.
</DIV>

<DIV align="left" style="font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 6pt; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 0; color: #000000; background: #ffffff;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
