Internal Revenue Code, referred to herein as
&#147;Section&nbsp;704(b) Regulations,&#148; provide complex
rules for determining (1)&nbsp;whether allocations will be
deemed to have economic effect, (2)&nbsp;whether the economic
effect of allocations will be deemed to be substantial, and
(3)&nbsp;whether allocations not having substantial economic
effect will nonetheless be deemed to be made in accordance with
a partner&#146;s interest in us.
</DIV>

