would be taxable as ordinary income. Any recapture of cost
recovery allowances taken previously by us with respect to
personal property associated with partnership real properties
will be treated as &#147;unrealized receivables&#148; for this
purpose. Investors should note in this regard that the Internal
Revenue Code requires us to report any sale of units to the
Internal Revenue Service if any portion of the gain realized
upon such sale is attributable to the transferor&#146;s share of
our &#147;Section&nbsp;751 property.&#148;
