<DIV align="left" style="font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 6pt; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 0; color: #000000; background: #ffffff;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
UMTH Land Development, L.P. (the &#147;Partnership&#148;) is a
Delaware limited partnership formed March&nbsp;14, 2003
(Inception) and began operations July&nbsp;1, 2003. The
Partnership is a wholly owned subsidiary of UMT Holdings, L.P.
(&#147;UMTH&#148;). The Partnership provides asset management
services for two funds, United Development Funding, L.P.
(&#147;UDF I&#148;) and United Development Funding&nbsp;II, L.
P. (&#147;UDF&nbsp;II&#148;). As asset manager, the Partnership
