</DIV>

<DIV align="left" style="font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 6pt; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 0; color: #000000; background: #ffffff;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
3.10&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<I>&#147;Capital
Contribution&#148; </I>shall mean, in the case of the General
Partner, the aggregate amount of cash contributed by the General
Partner to the Partnership and, in the case of a Limited
Partner, the gross amount of investment in the Partnership by
such Limited Partner, which shall be an amount equal to twenty
