Capital.</I> The General Partner shall not be personally liable
for the return of all or any part of the Capital Contributions
of the Limited Partners. Any such return shall be made solely
from Partnership assets.
</DIV>

<DIV align="left" style="font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 6pt; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 0; color: #000000; background: #ffffff;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
